1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,838
This is Flow Canvas:

2
00:00:02,822 --> 00:00:07,134
a process designer for Mendix that draws the flows your app already keeps.

3
00:00:08,516 --> 00:00:10,942
Here are three flows, kept three ways.

4
00:00:11,851 --> 00:00:13,264
Open the purchase request.

5
00:00:14,192 --> 00:00:16,179
Steps sit in a lane for each role.

6
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:19,333
A parallel review must all finish.

7
00:00:20,276 --> 00:00:23,426
The CFO step only runs above fifty thousand.

8
00:00:24,344 --> 00:00:25,856
And returns send work back.

9
00:00:26,828 --> 00:00:29,603
Problems from your own checks are marked right on the step.

10
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:32,211
Building is drag and drop.

11
00:00:33,358 --> 00:00:37,470
Drop a kind onto an edge, and it is inserted between the two steps.

12
00:00:38,398 --> 00:00:40,061
Drag a step into another lane.

13
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:43,590
Select two steps, and run them in parallel.

14
00:00:44,518 --> 00:00:46,568
Every gesture calls your microflow:

15
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:50,781
the canvas shows the change at once, and your app decides.

16
00:00:52,044 --> 00:00:56,156
Drag a step's handle back to an earlier step, and it can send the case back.

17
00:00:57,096 --> 00:00:59,122
The step menu holds your own actions.

18
00:01:00,036 --> 00:01:02,599
Make a step mandatory, and Delete is gone.

19
00:01:03,579 --> 00:01:05,304
Find any step with Control F.

20
00:01:06,228 --> 00:01:09,278
And the variant picker dims the steps of the other variant.

21
00:01:10,574 --> 00:01:12,462
The same widget shows a running case.

22
00:01:13,407 --> 00:01:14,706
The path it took is bold.

23
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:18,841
The current step says who it waits on, and since when.

24
00:01:19,754 --> 00:01:21,004
Next step moves it on.

25
00:01:22,226 --> 00:01:24,539
On the current step, your own actions:

26
00:01:25,466 --> 00:01:27,141
remind the owner, or skip.

27
00:01:28,058 --> 00:01:30,870
And an administrator can move the case to any step.

28
00:01:32,152 --> 00:01:33,903
Every text is translatable.

29
00:01:34,816 --> 00:01:38,904
Right to left mirrors the whole canvas, and dark mode follows your theme.

30
00:01:40,257 --> 00:01:46,544
Flow Canvas works from Mendix ten point six, keyboard first, and keeps your data and your rules in your app.

31
00:01:47,478 --> 00:01:49,603
Coming soon to the Mendix Marketplace.

